      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Plane of Tranquility [zone=159]\n**Who:**\n- Quellious [ _Goddess and Quest Giver_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Time:** | 360\n**Level:** | 75\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | No\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Related Zones:**\n- Plane of Health [zone=1057]\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Decay [zone=1059]\n- Sul Vius: Demiplane of Life [zone=1058]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Mayor Salvador West [ _Mayor and Quest Giver_]\n**Related Quests:**\n- Into the Temple (B) [quest=8081]\n- Seal of Approval [quest=8080]\n**Era:** | !The Broken Mirror\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 26 03:33:34 2015\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | You say, 'Hail, Quellious'\nQuellious says 'Hello friend. It is nice to return home. I hope things are well with you and that you have no [worries].'\nYou say, 'I hope that you don't have worries.'\nQuellious says 'Even gods have worries, I'm afraid. I, for example, am concerned for my friend Rodcet Nife. You see, he has found a new ally, whom I have not met. But from my conversations with him, I sense an unusual amount of inner conflict within him. I sense that the source of this conflict, and even the conflict itself is unknown to Rodcet. I believe it is this new alliance. It is as if in his heart he knows there is something wrong, but won't see what it is. I would like to speak with him about this, but I would like to know more first. I could use a [discreet] agent to learn about this new ally, Anashti Sul.'\nYou say, 'I am nothing if not discreet.\n'\nQuellious says 'Ah, thank you very much. Please, be careful and discreet. If I am wrong I would not like to cause my friend any turmoil.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Into the Temple.'\n\\-\\-\n'Into the Temple' is a shared task with a 6-hour time limit.\nThe first step is \"Speak with someone in authority in Sul Vius about the religion of Anashti Sul.\" (Status 0/1, Zone: ALL)\n\"At the prompting of the goddess of Tranquility, Quellious, you seek information about Anashti Sul. There is a good chance that some information about her can be found in her own realm. Find someone that can direct you to such information.\"\nFind your way to Sul Vius, Demiplane of Life. When you get there, find Mayor Salvador West.\nHail him and then say Anashti Sul\n\n---\n\n7 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience\nRemnants of Tranquility (Variable number of Remnants of Tranquility based on your level)\nThis unlocks the Seal of Approval [quest=8080] task in Plane of Health. Doing both tasks (they're easy and don't require any killing) gives close to a full level of experience at level 75.\n**Submitted by:** Oxgoad\n- Remnant of Tranquility [item=124218]",
